{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "home-loan-calculator-backend-collection",
    "name": "Home Loan Calculator Backend",
    "description": "# Home Loan Calculator Backend API\n\nThis collection contains all endpoints for the Home Loan Calculator backend service.\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Import the `local.postman_environment.json` environment file\n2. Set `baseUrl` variable (default: `http://localhost:3001`)\n3. Ensure the backend server is running\n\n## Happy Path Workflow\n\n1. **Health Check**: Run `Health - GET /health` to verify server is up\n2. **DB Health**: Run `Health - GET /health/db` to verify database connection\n3. **Basic EMI Calculation**: Run `Loan - POST /loan/calculate` with sample loan parameters\n4. **Prepayment Scenarios**: Run `Loan - POST /loan/calculate-with-prepayments` to see impact of prepayments\n5. **What-If Analysis**: Run `Loan - POST /loan/what-if` to explore different scenarios\n\n## Notes\n\n- All monetary values are in INR (₹)\n- Interest rates are annual percentages (e.g., 8.5 = 8.5%)\n- Tenure is in months\n- Global prefix: `/api/v1`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "{{baseUrl}}",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
